1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,440
Hey, uh, what's all this?

2
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:13,740
It's that little girl. She has returned. Fapta, that is.

3
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:14,760
Fapta.

4
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,820
What the? I remember.

5
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,560
I had you breathe in my experiences.

6
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:30,340
Smells are memories themselves, and like dreams, they are volatile.

7
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,180
But I do hope that they touched you.

8
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,260
Why would you do that?

9
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,400
Like all things, I must go.

10
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:44,120
And so, Nanachi, I've entrusted you with both my value and memories.

11
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:47,960
I like you, kids. You are not like me.

12
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,040
And that is the reason why.

13
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,500
Where's Riko? And where's Rek?

14
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,220
They are still here.

15
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:05,160
However, Fapta will not stop until she burns everything to ash.

16
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:11,740
You should go. I have already released you.

17
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:15,280
You can go wherever you please now.

18
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,300
You're fine with that?

19
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:21,880
Well, then, I think I'll go before you change your mind.

20
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:23,740
Thanks for your help.

21
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:26,580
Nanachi, over there.

22
00:01:29,740 --> 00:01:31,560
That is the boundary line.

23
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:35,200
If you pass through it, Mithi will disappear.

24
00:01:39,820 --> 00:01:40,840
Wait, what?

25
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:42,680
What are you saying?

26
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:46,220
I mean, Mithi's immortal, isn't she?

27
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:51,680
That which has been created inside the village can only exist within the village.

28
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:57,820
As I was created as the village's limbs, I am capable of enduring some, but there are no exceptions.

29
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,380
Beyond that point, the protection of the village melts away.

30
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,660
This area will not last long either.

31
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:10,660
The force field is creeping in.

32
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:15,340
If you remain here, I shall do my utmost to protect you.

33
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:19,100
Well, I see Piggymule and the others have also taken a liking to you.

34
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,240
Rico.

35
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:22,620
Wreck.

36
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:24,180
Damn it.

37
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:27,540
Isn't there something I can do?

38
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:32,260
I mean, I so wanted to see Mithi.

39
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:37,160
I didn't think I could ever see her again.

40
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:38,920
Mithi.

41
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:43,440
What should I do?

42
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:55,360
This Mithi, you know, is still the same Mithi from before Bondaroon.

43
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:58,160
She was hurt in so many ways.

44
00:02:58,980 --> 00:03:00,460
In her cute little pot.

45
00:03:01,460 --> 00:03:03,100
She's beautiful like this.

46
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,840
I was just so happy.

47
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:08,000
So I got the wrong idea.

48
00:03:09,180 --> 00:03:13,820
I thought we could stay here together forever.

49
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:17,640
Even though I know I didn't receive this body.

50
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:20,640
Just to lie around and sleep about.

51
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:24,660
Those memories I shared with you put you to sleep.

52
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,440
That's okay.

53
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:30,180
Either way, I would have chosen to stay by Mithi's side.

54
00:03:30,900 --> 00:03:32,220
That's the way I am.

55
00:03:32,220 --> 00:03:34,520
I know that about myself.

56
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,880
Belov, I'll be going now.

57
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,960
I made a promise with Mithi.

58
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:47,360
That if things turned out like this, I'd make it so her soul returns to me.

59
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:53,020
I don't want to do anything else that might make Mithi grow to hate me.

60
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:57,460
This time, I can see her off by my own hand.

61
00:03:57,460 --> 00:04:02,800
Goodbye, Belov.

62
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:06,680
Thanks for taking a liking to my...

63
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,340
my Mithi.

64
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:23,560
Mithi, listen.

65
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:26,780
I learned how to cook some new dishes.

66
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:29,320
They come out looking all crazy.

67
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:31,940
But they're unbelievably tasty.

68
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:36,860
Oh, and I made friends I'm going adventuring with.

69
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:40,020
They both know about you and what you mean.

70
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,480
I am...

71
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:44,780
Well, you know...

72
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:45,780
I wish...

73
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:46,780
I wish...

74
00:04:46,780 --> 00:04:47,780
I wish...

75
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:51,940
I wish that I could have talked to you more.

76
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:55,080
And if I ever...

77
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:59,840
If I ever find you in your current form again, I'm sure...

78
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:02,240
I won't know what to do then, too.

79
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:05,800
So next time, really scold me, okay?

80
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,800
Next time, we'll go together.

81
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,600
It will eat some yummy stuff.

82
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:12,960
I'll be...

83
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:15,060
sure to find you again.

84
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:19,140
I'll definitely go and see you, Mithi.

85
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,980
So then...

86
00:05:20,980 --> 00:05:22,440
So please...

87
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:25,720
Please wait for me.

88
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:48,680
What are you guys doing?

89
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,680
Mithi!

90
00:05:50,680 --> 00:06:03,640
Made for you with outside stuff, so that it don't disappear.

91
00:06:04,140 --> 00:06:05,260
Take with you.

92
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:18,340
Longing.

93
00:06:19,340 --> 00:06:20,020
Impurity.

94
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,640
Joy.

95
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,520
Pain.

96
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:26,360
I have cast them all away.

97
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,760
Pick them up.

98
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,080
And carry them with you.

99
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:33,640
All that you gather...

100
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,880
Is your value.

101
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:57,060
Thank goodness you're all right.

102
00:06:57,060 --> 00:06:58,260
Reg, you woke up!

103
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:59,020
Sorry.

104
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,100
Thank goodness you're all right.

105
00:07:04,380 --> 00:07:05,220
It's you!

106
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,240
It protected us.

107
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:10,060
It made sure we didn't get caught up in all the mayhem.

108
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:11,980
Thank you for that.

109
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:16,400
Reg, neither Fopta nor the village will stop.

110
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:19,080
Reg, the eternal peace has been broken.

111
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:22,580
You made the choice not to leave.

112
00:07:22,580 --> 00:07:25,420
Now is the time to show your resolve.

113
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:30,020
Reg, if we don't do something fast.

114
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:34,640
The things everyone treasures, and the ones they hold dear will...

115
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:50,140
The light, large and bright, shines with undying curiosity and a hallowed curtain.

116
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:55,260
It burns all it gazes upon.

117
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:58,420
It has now become a scorching sun.

118
00:07:58,420 --> 00:08:08,060
It is time to face it.

119
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:10,660
Show your resolve.

120
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:11,300
Ow.

121
00:08:11,300 --> 00:08:12,400
Ow.

122
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:18,960
Oh.

123
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:24,260
It's so funny.

124
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:30,520
Gah.

125
00:08:34,660 --> 00:08:35,660
I'm so paraphrasing.

126
00:08:36,020 --> 00:08:36,800
Ah!

127
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:39,800
Inbelieve!

128
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:40,800
Ani!

129
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:42,800
Emigutsu!

130
00:08:42,800 --> 00:09:08,800
The balancing is making the villagers eat into each other.

131
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:11,800
It's even spreading to the buildings.

132
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:12,800
And the walls.

133
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,800
Guess we've got about another 30 minutes.

134
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,800
This will be difficult.

135
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:18,800
What do you mean?

136
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:19,800
What'll be difficult?

137
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,800
I can't tell you.

138
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:24,800
You know how bad at lying I am.

139
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,800
Greg, those guys.

140
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,800
It was all thanks to them I was able to survive.

141
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:34,800
If this keeps up, everyone's treasured things on themselves.

142
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,800
Oh, Riko.

143
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,800
You did a really good job.

144
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:40,800
You didn't rush into things.

145
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:46,800
I am going to stop, Fapta.

146
00:09:46,800 --> 00:09:52,800
Well, Prince, everything hinges on you and what you do now.

147
00:09:52,800 --> 00:10:04,800
I'm sorry, Fapta.

148
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:09,800
A member of our team, Nanachi, is being held captive.

149
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:13,800
Please don't destroy any more of the village.

150
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:15,800
Go and save Nanachi.

151
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,800
Fapta won't stop you.

152
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,800
Don't use your friend as an excuse.

153
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,800
You try not to hurt Fapta.

154
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,800
So you lie to me again, Sosu?

155
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:25,800
Come out and say it, Sosu.

156
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:27,800
What is it you want?

157
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:29,800
Sorry for being selfish.

158
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:32,800
But Fapta, I will stop you.

159
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,800
And I will save Nanachi!

160
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:39,800
Reg, you are kind, Sosu.

161
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:43,800
If you are to do it, it is better to take me by surprise.

162
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,800
Understood.

163
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:53,800
Then Fapta will make you remember what you are meant to do.

164
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:57,800
Even if it means beating you into nothing, Sosu!

165
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,800
Answer me!

166
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,800
Come on, Gabu!

167
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:10,800
You are supposed to protect Fapta forever!

168
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,800
Gah!

169
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:12,800
Gabu!

170
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:14,800
It was that one!

171
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:17,800
Tall, ugly, beast-learned Gabu-run-set!

172
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,800
That one did it!

173
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:21,800
What to do?

174
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:24,800
Even if Fapta drives it away now...

175
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:26,800
It'll be back!

176
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:27,800
It's too much!

177
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:32,800
Arasa Bako Dundua?

178
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:39,800
Domeo?

179
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:42,800
Who are you, boy?

180
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:47,800
What are you doing?

181
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:50,800
Do not touch Gabu!

182
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:58,800
First time that we met, Fapta thought at Sosu.

183
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,800
That ornament on your head...

184
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:03,800
Looked so much like Gabu-run.

185
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:07,800
So Fapta was happy one of Gabu's allies.

186
00:12:08,800 --> 00:12:09,800
Come to help Sosu.

187
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:12,800
I'm sorry, I...

188
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:14,800
I don't know what you mean.

189
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,800
Even though we couldn't communicate in words,

190
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:19,800
you protected us until Gabu began to move again.

191
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,800
The way you were so kind to me,

192
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:26,800
having met Fapta every single thing.

193
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:29,800
But you forget it all.

194
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:34,800
So long as the slimy things remain,

195
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,800
there'll be no end to this.

196
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:39,800
Where'd she go?

197
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:41,800
No, wait.

198
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:42,800
Is she...

199
00:12:43,800 --> 00:12:44,800
She's behind me!

200
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:49,800
If beating your exterior does not work,

201
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,800
Fapta will try from inside Sosu.

202
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,800
Reg!

203
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:54,800
Reg!

204
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:01,800
Remember now, Sosu.

205
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,800
Fapta not understand what you say, Sosu.

206
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:25,800
Sosu, do you remember anything yet?

207
00:13:26,800 --> 00:13:27,800
Dammit!

208
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:29,800
Never do that again!

209
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:30,800
Never!

210
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:32,800
If you're truly a princess, show more grace!

211
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:34,800
Fapta is graceful, Sosu.

212
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:37,800
Even my words, just like you told me to!

213
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:41,800
Why would I tell you to speak in such a strange way?

214
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,800
That's not it, Sosu!

215
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:45,800
Fapta wise!

216
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:47,800
Fapta wise!

217
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:51,800
The boy wants to know if you are Fapta.

218
00:13:52,800 --> 00:13:53,800
Gabu?

219
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:55,800
You can really understand the boy's language?

220
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:57,800
Kumu?

221
00:13:58,800 --> 00:13:59,800
Igaragadu?

222
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:02,800
It is similar to that of those who pass through on occasion.

223
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:04,800
Huh?

224
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:06,800
The ones who carry around those stone people?

225
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:11,800
But this one is nice and isn't terrifying unlike those others that come around.

226
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:12,800
It's good.

227
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:14,800
Anyway, what are you?

228
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:16,800
Wagaramea?

229
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,800
I'm Reg.

230
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:20,800
R-E-G.

231
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,800
You're Reg?

232
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:23,800
So you are called Reg?

233
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:24,800
R-E-G.

234
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:31,800
Faun.

235
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:32,800
Noble maiden.

236
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:34,800
Opta.

237
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:35,800
Immortal one.

238
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,800
Together it is Fapta.

239
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:39,800
Princess who cannot perish!

240
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:41,800
You learn languages incredibly fast.

241
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:43,800
It's almost scary, really.

242
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:45,800
That so?

243
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:46,800
Gabu praised me for it too!

244
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:49,800
Hold it!

245
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:50,800
Why are you biting me?

246
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:52,800
Don't go in there!

247
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:54,800
Aren't you a princess?

248
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:56,800
Come on now, be a bit more graceful!

249
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:03,800
In your mother's tongue, it is considered graceful to add Sosu at the end of speech.

250
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:05,800
Fapta Sosu.

251
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:07,800
Just like this Sosu?

252
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:09,800
Splendid, Sosu.

253
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:12,800
Sosu!

254
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:13,800
Sosu!

255
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:16,800
Well, I...

256
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,800
I guess my mentor did say it's important...

257
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:21,800
To keep up appearances.

258
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:23,800
Fapta.

259
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:25,800
This is...

260
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:27,800
Well, um...

261
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:29,800
It's a symbol of friendship.

262
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:31,800
It would make me happy...

263
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:33,800
If you wore it.

264
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:34,800
I'm not...

265
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:36,800
I'm not...

266
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:38,800
Reg...

267
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:39,800
Smells like you, Sosu.

268
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:41,800
Aaaaaaah!

269
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:43,800
What's the matter?

270
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,800
Were you not going to stop Fapta Sosu?

271
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:51,800
I might pass out before I can actually start remembering anything.

272
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:52,800
The ceiling's caving in.

273
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:56,800
No!

274
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:58,800
I'm running out of time!

275
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:03,800
There's no telling how my body will react.

276
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:05,800
But I have to.

277
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:07,800
Riko!

